{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a6cedaa3-5172-59a8-b995-ba479b01c8f2", "source_ordinal": 2417, "reading_ordinal": 1637, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "修行实践", "published_at": "2023-01-26T18:38:09+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/382191130/answer/2861182866"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这东西要避免神秘化、深奥化，因为神秘化的东西除了拿来当情绪吗啡，基本没有正面意义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "基本来说，所谓的“修心”，就是在不断的修正自己对世界的认识和个人原则，以达成下面的具体目标：", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）作为主体，逻辑通顺，规则稳固，让别人的合作意愿有清晰明了的实现方法，在微观层面实现个人生存环境的构建和治理。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）作为客体，对世界的规则谦卑和尊重，安然顺应，消除一切无谓痛苦，在宏观层面帮助世界形成宽松积极的生存环境。", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 200}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-01/26/d2df33b797e9bef52804ff82dcc4dfac.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0249"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：什么是修心的最高境界?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004"], "summary": "围绕“修行实践”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这东西要避免神秘化、深奥化，因为神秘化的东西除了拿来当情绪吗啡，基本没有正面意义。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这东西要避免神秘化、深奥化，因为神秘化的东西除了拿来当情绪吗啡，基本没有正面意义。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
